WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.548
Welcome to JMB Hub. This tour covers sign-in, the dashboard, games, tools, virtual credits, your profile, and how to get help.

00:00:11.198 --> 00:00:23.501
Open the official JMB Hub website and choose Launch JMB Hub. Create an account or sign in, verify your email when asked, and never share passwords or sign-in codes.

00:00:24.151 --> 00:00:36.597
Your dashboard is the home base. Use its cards or menu to open Games, JMB Area, Security Lab, Minecraft, JMB AI, JMB Coins, and Support.

00:00:37.247 --> 00:00:49.809
Open Games, choose a game, and read its controls. For a tool, read its description, enter your content, then choose the action. Some tools run locally in your browser.

00:00:50.459 --> 00:01:04.927
JMB Coins are virtual portal credits, not cash or cryptocurrency. Check your wallet history. Rewards and admin gifts depend on coin services being online; report failed claims to Support.

00:01:05.577 --> 00:01:16.145
Use Profile to update supported details. Birthday sharing is optional; the public list shows your display name and day and month, not your birth year.

00:01:16.795 --> 00:01:30.937
Open Help and Guide for instructions or create a Support ticket with the page name and exact error. Never share passwords, sign-in codes, or recovery phrases. Sign out on shared devices.
